hifiberry-mpd (0.24.5.5) stable; urgency=low

  * Created separate start-mpd script for user validation and service startup
  * Added user validation check - only allow running as root or user in
    /etc/hifiberry.user
  * Updated systemd service to use start-mpd wrapper script instead of
    direct MPD execution
  * Added manual page for start-mpd script
  * Exit with code 0 to prevent systemd restart attempts on authorization
    failure
  * Improved service architecture consistency with other HiFiBerry services

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 09 Oct 2025 20:00:00 +0000

